  "ruleText": "Saf-C 413.02 Boat Safety Course. Any person who pays the administrative penalty set forth in Saf-C 412.01, and completes an approved boat safety course within 6 months of the date of conviction, shall receive a $200 refund from the division.\n\nSource. #4715, eff 12-5-89; ss by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES, 5-3-95; ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95, EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8172, eff 9-21-04; (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading) renumbered by #9544 (formerly Saf-C 412.02); ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
